        <briefdescription>
<para>Build dense candidates via configured <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_i_vectorizer" kindref="compound">IVectorizer</ref> and fuse them with BM25. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This is an integration helper for DPR-style bi-encoders: query text is encoded via <computeroutput>encodeQuery()</computeroutput>, each BM25 candidate content is encoded via <computeroutput>encodePassage()</computeroutput>, cosine similarity is used as dense score, then standard <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_hybrid_retriever_1a59668eb561798fb677664fa616055c4c" kindref="member">fuse()</ref> is applied.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Query text to encode. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>bm25_candidates</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>BM25/sparse candidates (input pool for dense scoring). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Fused hybrid result. </para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="exception"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::invalid_argument</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>if query is empty. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::runtime_error</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>if no vectorizer is configured or not initialized. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
