    <briefdescription>
<para>RAG-level hybrid retriever fusing BM25 and vector candidate lists. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Usage (RRF, default): <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">HybridRetrieverConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.bm25_weight<sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>0.4;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.vector_weight<sp/>=<sp/>0.6;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.top_k<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>10;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_hybrid_retriever_1aa6aea77b1051e9e62af40c4733ef8b7c" kindref="member">HybridRetriever</ref><sp/>retriever(cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>retriever.fuse(bm25_candidates,<sp/>vector_candidates);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">for</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal">&amp;<sp/>doc<sp/>:<sp/>result.documents)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>doc.id<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;<sp/><sp/>score=&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>doc.similarity_score<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Usage (linear combination): <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">HybridRetrieverConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.use_rrf<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">false</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.bm25_weight<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>0.3;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.vector_weight<sp/><sp/>=<sp/>0.7;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_hybrid_retriever_1aa6aea77b1051e9e62af40c4733ef8b7c" kindref="member">HybridRetriever</ref><sp/>retriever(cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>retriever.fuse(bm25_candidates,<sp/>vector_candidates);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Performance targets:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>RRF mode: &lt;1 ms for 100 candidates</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Linear mode: &lt;1 ms for 100 candidates</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Recall@10 (RRF, balanced weights): ≥ 85 % </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
